# Labelled fixtures whose bytes ARE the test. Git must never normalise them:
# tests/corpus/targets/ carries a CRLF Makefile and two UTF-8-BOM Makefiles
# whose whole purpose is to reach detect's parser exactly as written, and
# the phrasing corpora are labelled JSONL kept byte-exact so labels stay
# diff-stable. `-text` disables end-of-line
# conversion on every platform (the `test-windows` CI leg checks out with
# Git for Windows' autocrlf default, which would otherwise rewrite them).
tests/corpus/targets/** -text
tests/fixtures/phrasing/** -text
